// compiler changes its effect join: the twin's total census is NOT zero, and the first
// version of this leg (ExpectZeroDiagnostics) refused its own control for exactly that
// reason (legW FAIL, 2026-11-25). The premises below state the measured shape exactly: zero
// BLOCKING rows (the wall makes no refusal here - the census classifies this site CLEAN),
// one advisory row, one row total, and the row belongs to the EffectSummaryIncompleteAtFunctionValue
// class. The advisory's subject (the caller identity, module-qualified "....apply2") is
// pinned in the corpus row's ExpectAcceptedCounted class; it is not double-counted here.
test fn floor_field_through_generics_deferral_lambda_param_green_control_is_accepted() -> ProcessExit {
